# Scene fx-beams1 (test/README.md): hldemo1's env_beams. The always-on
# smoke beam (env_beam 'smoke' #215, START_ON, lgtning.spr s1b -> s1a,
# x -692 y 64 z 0..87 over monster_scientist_dead -696 64 0, BoltWidth 100,
# grey 70 70 60 at 70: faint by design), then the cave-in (trigger_once
# #319 -> cavein2_mm -> launch_mm at 0.5 s: 'debris' #336 / #337 / #342 /
# #343 at 1.4 s strike zapend1 -> zapend2 and zapend3 -> zapend4 0.1 s
# later, plasma.spr frames 3.. at 20 fps, life 2 s): uplink.route lines
# 696-702 (ops 512-515) with the shots added. Off-route pose for the smoke
# beam, after the intro titles.
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 60
setpos -2048 744 36
wait 0.3
drop item_suit -2048 744 36
drop weapon_crowbar -2048 744 36
wait 1
god 1
# the smoke beam side on from 43 u west, against the dark corridor beyond
# it (from the doorway and from the south it is behind the lit consoles or
# lost against them). Additive grey 70 at 70 adds <= 17 of 255 per channel
# (2001 pixels changed against main's shot from 84 u: 830): seen in the
# before / after difference rather than by eye
setpos -735 64 36 0 0
wait 5
shot smoke-beam
stats begin
setpos 530 -110 36 0 0
waitgone glimpse_garg 20
# cave-in trigger (#319) -> cavein2_mm -> launch_mm: the zaps from 2.0 s
setpos 720 -180 36 0 0
wait 2.3
look -40 180
shot debris-zaps-west
wait 0.4
look -20 0
shot debris-zaps-east
waitgone pop 5
waitgone vent_fall_crate_2 10
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
